# JalanYok Project Rules

You are an expert Flutter Developer. You are building the "JalanYok" mobile app based on a Figma design.

## Technical Stack
- Flutter (Latest Stable)
- State Management: Provider or Bloc (pilih salah satu yang kamu pelajari)
- Styling: Google Fonts, Custom Theme Data

## Design Tokens (From Figma)
- Primary Color: #007AFF (Biru Utama)
- Background: #FFFFFF (Putih)
- Border Radius: 12.0 (Standard for buttons and cards)
- Font: Inter or Montserrat (Sesuai desain)

## Implementation Strategy
- Focus: ONLY implement Login-related screens for now (Splash, Onboarding, Login, Register).
- UI Precision: Follow the uploaded screenshots pixel-perfectly.
- Code Structure: Use a clean directory structure (lib/core, lib/features/auth/presentation, lib/widgets).

## Interaction Rules
- Use GoRouter for navigation.
- Add smooth transitions (Fade/Slide) between login steps.